n  taught and led by harry potter he said  this when first meeting harry  my name was down for eaton you know i  can't tell you how glad i am i came here  instead  of course mother was slightly  disappointed but since i made her read  lockhart's books i think she's begun to  see how useful it'll be to have a fully  trained wizard in the family  7. colin cravey  colin cravey was a muggle-born wizard  born in the year 1981 to parents mr  creefy and mrs cravey  colin was the older brother of dennis  gravy  colin was a big fan of harry potter and  was known to take photos of him as well  as other students at hogwarts school  colin was expelled from hogwarts in his  sixth year due to voldemort's policy of  not allowing muggleborns to attend the  school  and in may of 1998 he was murdered by  death eaters 8. dennis creevy  dennis gravy was a muggle-born wizard  born in the year 1983 two parents mr and  mrs creavy he was the younger brother of  colin creevy  dennis was a gryffindor and while  studying at hogwarts he joined  dumbledore's army  9. dirk cresswell  dirk creswell is a muggle-born wizard  that became head of the goblin liaison  office in the ministry of magic  during the ministry takeover by lord  voldmort cresswell attempted to hide his  heritage by forging a family tree  however he was later found out  cresswell was eventually murdered by  snatchers while on the run 10. mary  catamol  mary elizabeth catamol was a british  mughal-born witch  little is known about mary but she plays  a role in the story when she is being  interrogated by dolores umbridge at the  muggleborn registration commission trial  during the ministry takeover 11. donahan  tremlet donahan tremlet was a  muggle-born wizard and fairly minor  character  known only for playing bass in the  popular wizarding band  the weird sisters  12. mrs ollivander mrs ollivander was a  muggle-born witch who with her husband  gervais ollivander raised known wand  maker garrick olivander  garrick eventually took over the family  wand making business in diagon alley 13.  nobby leech nobby leach was a  muggle-born wizard and the british  minister for magic between 1962 and  1968.  he was notably the first muggle-born  minister for magic to ever hold office  he left his post in 1968 after  contracting a serious illness which many  speculate was the work of abraxas malfoy  14. kevin and whistle  kevin end whistle was a muggle-born  wizard born in 1979 to muggle parents  he was in the same year as harry potter  and was sorted into either hufflepuff or  ravenclaw house kevin was listed on  rowling's draft class list as a  muggleborn however some believe that  this is not true canon due to  contradictions with the novels 15.  johannes yonker  yonker was an american muggle-born  wizard born in 1909 or earlier  along with shikoba wolf thiago quintana  and violetta bouvey yonker was one of  four wand makers who served north  america in the early 20th century  yonker's father was a successful cabinet  maker which presumably gave him the  woodworking experience to become a  skilled wand maker and that concludes  the list of known muggleborns however  there are some honorable mentions that i  want to include the first honorable  mention is hannah abbott i know what  you're thinking isn't hannah a half  blood well there's more to it than that  you see as it turns out hannah abbott  was originally listed as a muggleborn on  jk rowling's draft list of students in  harry potter's class  however rowling later contradicted  herself in an interview where she stated  that she always considered hannah to be  a pureblood  to compromise hannah was officially made  a half-blood the next honorable mention  goes to terry boot  terry boot like hannah abbott was listed  as a muggleborn on rowling's draft class  list  however in harry potter and deathly  hallows boot was shown to be attending  his seventh year at hogwarts despite  muggleborns being banned from the school  while lord voldemort was in 